Package: timescapes
Title: Quantifying Temporal Structure Across Landscapes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Logan", "Hysen", email = "hysenlog@msu.edu",
             role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
      person("Ho Yi", "Wan", email = "wanhoyi@ufl.edu",
             role = c("aut", "cph"))
    )
Description: Calculates interpretable mathematical summaries of binary
    conditions observed through time. Metrics can be calculated for a single
    binary vector or independently for every cell in a raster time series.
